Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.18,0:00:39.58,Karaoke Translation op,TITLE,0,0,0,,{\3c&HFFFFFF&\fscx150\fscy120\c&H000000&\move(342,350,318,348,1,4380)}Space Battleship
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.73,0:00:39.58,yamato,TITLE,0,0,0,,{\c&H0000FF&\fscx347\fscy257\pos(868,926)}Yamato
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.78,0:00:39.58,Karaoke Translation op,TITLE,0,0,0,,{\3c&HFFFFFF&\fscx167\fscy142\c&H000000&\move(1490,872,1510,886,3,3840)}Soldiers of Love
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.31,0:02:19.31,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,That's enough !
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.36,0:02:29.03,def2,ZA,0,0,0,,You've improved a lot, Lord Nol.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.69,0:02:47.58,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,You must have noticed from the\N last match that Nol lacks something.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.23,0:02:53.10,def2,GO,0,0,0,,I want him to learn that. \NHis first battle is soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.68,0:02:55.88,def2,ZA,0,0,0,,Is that why you're taking him out hunting ? {Can't hear exactly what. Could be sand dragon, could be a proper noun}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.88,0:03:00.74,def2,GO,0,0,0,,Right. It's only a small group, \Nso it won't affect the defense of Telezart.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.70,0:03:07.98,def2,ZA,0,0,0,,Since the unbeatable Goland \Nfleet is covering us in orbit...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.98,0:03:11.99,def2,ZA,0,0,0,,...I feel as if our Zarvival ground forces are on leave.{have been given leave.}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.92,0:03:15.98,def2,ZA,0,0,0,,Take your entire fleet if you like.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.98,0:03:19.35,def2,ZA,0,0,0,,Our division is more than \Nadequate for a planet like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.49,0:03:22.58,def2,GO,0,0,0,,You haven't changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.94,0:03:29.63,def2,ZA,0,0,0,,Neither have you. I feel like I'm\N talking to the late King Goland.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.20,0:03:34.93,def2,ZA,0,0,0,,He spared no effort in training his own cadets.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.02,0:03:37.07,def2,ZA,0,0,0,,But that's...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.71,0:03:44.74,def2,ZA,0,0,0,,...no different than the taboo\N of self-esteem among Gatlantians.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.72,0:03:52.10,def2,GO,0,0,0,,Even so, he'll eventually take my position in the fleet and succeed the name of Goland.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.65,0:03:54.34,def2,ZA,0,0,0,,His highness Nol is...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.34,0:03:59.75,def2,GAILANE,0,0,0,,Strange. Gatlantis has no \Nconcept of parent or child.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.47,0:04:05.11,def2,GAILANE,0,0,0,,Even so, they talk like human father and son.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.62,0:04:11.91,def2,GAILANE,0,0,0,,Even though we're manufactured, \Nwe're an intelligent humanoid life form.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.54,0:04:14.84,def2,GAILANE,0,0,0,,If so, we might...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.84,0:04:16.43,def2,ZO,0,0,0,,Enough, Gailane.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.89,0:04:21.63,def2,ZO,0,0,0,,Telezart emits infinite power.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.63,0:04:26.79,def2,ZO,0,0,0,,Once I get a hold of Teresa, the source\N of that power, our wish will be granted.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.73,0:04:31.07,def2,ZO,0,0,0,,Everything else is a mere sideshow.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.05,0:04:37.70,def2,GAILANE,0,0,0,,Does that include the space battleship Yamato, \Nthe ship called by Teresa ?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.71,0:04:48.19,def2,GAILANE,0,0,0,,It was supposed to perish along with a Garmillas fleet by proving that their sense of love is nothing but ego.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.19,0:04:52.55,def2,GAILANE,0,0,0,,{ano}But that ship managed to escape\N the danger without losing any lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.08,0:04:56.18,def2,ZO,0,0,0,,It was just a coincidence. \NDon't overestimate its potential.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.78,0:05:01.19,def2,GAILANE,0,0,0,,There's no possibility of a coincidence\N being part of Teresa's prayer.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.23,0:05:07.77,def2,GAILANE,0,0,0,,The Yamato responded to the prayer,\N and it's coming to meet Teresa.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.90,0:05:14.92,def2,GAILANE,0,0,0,,It is fortunate that a copy of a living body \Nhas managed to sneak aboard the Yamato.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.92,0:05:17.99,def2,GAILANE,0,0,0,,However, I must doubt whether it's a coincidence or not.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.49,0:05:23.02,def2,GAILANE,0,0,0,,I see fear in you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.81,0:05:27.42,def2,GAILANE,0,0,0,,Is it of Teresa or...?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.82,0:05:30.58,def2,KATSURAGI,0,0,0,,Doctor, it's ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.58,0:05:34.83,def2,SADO,0,0,0,,It's no wonder why you have a medical license.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.83,0:05:37.08,def2,KATSURAGI,0,0,0,,It's only from expedited training \Nduring war-time though...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.16,0:05:41.14,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,What is it ?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.08,0:05:44.11,def2,SADO,0,0,0,,Oh, it's nothing. You're fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.55,0:05:46.07,def2,YUKI,0,0,0,,No abnormalities ?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.07,0:05:49.38,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Sorry. \NMori is way too concerned.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.38,0:05:51.52,def2,SADO,0,0,0,,Perhaps I should prescribe some vitamin tablets.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.52,0:05:53.52,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,I don't need any. Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.18,0:06:18.08,def2,KEYMAN,0,0,0,,What's the holdup this time ?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.08,0:06:20.95,def2,KEYMAN,0,0,0,,You were determined to take the Yamato out, despite the risk of becoming rebels.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.35,0:06:23.78,def2,SHIMA,0,0,0,,We've completed a third of our trip.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.78,0:06:26.78,def2,If,0,0,0,,If we maintain this course for Telezart...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.87,0:06:30.36,def2,SHIMA,0,0,0,,....there will be the White Comet right ahead of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.26,0:06:39.22,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,Kodai, did the guy who manipulated the professor say that the White Comet was their homeland ?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.17,0:06:41.64,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,No, not clearly.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.14,0:06:43.38,def2,KEYMAN,0,0,0,,That's pretty vague.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.38,0:06:48.95,def2,KATO,0,0,0,,The message from Telezart is unclear, too. There was no follow-up after the first one.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.57,0:06:55.54,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,Either way, we can't ignore the risk of the\N Yamato facing the main forces of our enemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.22,0:07:00.42,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,If we need to return to Earth to reorganize our forces, now is the time to withdraw.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.14,0:07:06.49,def2,CHIEF,0,0,0,,{\c&HEEEDB8&}To the Yamato crew, it looks like you're quite far away.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.27,0:07:10.66,def2,CHIEF,0,0,0,,{\c&HEEEDB8&}I'm going to deliver the decision made by Earth HQ.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.46,0:07:18.91,def2,CHIEF,0,0,0,,{\c&HEEEDB8&}We want you to maintain your current course, \Nand obtain as much intel as possible on the White Comet.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.79,0:07:25.53,def2,CHIEF,0,0,0,,{\c&HEEEDB8&}Discovery and arrival at \NTelezart were our objectives, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.53,0:07:29.04,def2,CHIEF,0,0,0,,{\c&HEEEDB8&}...if the White Comet is a \Nmajor outpost of Gatlantis...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.59,0:07:31.48,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,..."get closer for recon ?"
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.24,0:07:35.59,def2,CHIEF,0,0,0,,{\c&HEEEDB8&}I'm not saying how close.\N I'll leave that decision up to the Yamato's crew.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.42,0:07:39.16,def2,YUKI,0,0,0,,Kodai...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.71,0:07:44.43,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Don't worry. \NThe Yamato's objectives haven't changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.53,0:07:47.62,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,We'll keep going as planned.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.16,0:07:51.23,def2,SADO,0,0,0,,About the Acting Captain...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.78,0:07:54.32,def2,SADO,0,0,0,,He seems to be exhausted,\N both mentally and physically.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.30,0:08:00.43,def2,SADO,0,0,0,,{teresa}He's been tense ever since he \Nreceived the message from Teresa.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.31,0:08:06.33,def2,SADO,0,0,0,,{hadoho}The concern over the wave motion gun, and the shock and pressure of making contact with Gatlantis...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.38,0:08:11.46,def2,HIJIKATA,0,0,0,,It's normal to act abnormally ?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.90,0:08:16.81,def2,SADO,0,0,0,,He acts tough, but he's naive inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.48,0:08:19.41,def2,YUKI,0,0,0,,Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.68,0:08:33.34,def2,HIJIKATA,0,0,0,,Don't worry. \NKodai will pull through this journey.{quest.}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.50,0:08:40.51,def2,HIJIKATA,0,0,0,,You chose him. \NWho else could trust him better ?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.29,0:08:42.10,def2,YUKI,0,0,0,,Right...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.29,0:08:45.88,def2,YUKI,0,0,0,,That's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.44,0:08:52.53,def2,SAITO,0,0,0,,We're the only ground forces here. \NThere are no replacements.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.53,0:08:56.42,def2,SAITO,0,0,0,,We must use our skills to make up\N for inadequate protection and firepower.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.07,0:09:01.02,def2,SAITO,0,0,0,,What's that ?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.46,0:09:02.34,def2,NAGAKURA,0,0,0,,{\c&HEEEDB8&}Commander...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.71,0:09:14.76,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,What's that ?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.02,0:09:30.25,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,It looks like some kind of living organism, \Nbut they might pose a risk without further analysis...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.79,0:09:33.40,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,{pellet}...so make sure no one lets \Nthem out of the canisters{ containers.}{escape the pellet.}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.91,0:09:37.08,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,It looks beautiful, but I can't let it fly freely, huh ?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.00,0:09:40.09,def2,KATO,0,0,0,,Shino, Yamato is a warship.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.63,0:09:41.59,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.18,0:09:46.88,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,No, I heard Mr. Sanada wanted some samples.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.88,0:09:48.88,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,I heard it was Chief Intelligence Officer Niimi.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.35,0:09:51.03,def2,SHINOHARA,0,0,0,,Hey, Ms. Niimi is...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.03,0:09:52.90,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,Oh, she's on Earth now.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.90,0:09:54.90,def2,KATO,0,0,0,,Where did that rumor come from ?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.71,0:10:01.52,def2,NANBU,0,0,0,,Oh, Acting Captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.63,0:10:02.34,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Nanbu...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.30,0:10:04.78,def2,NANBU,0,0,0,,They're fireflies.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.78,0:10:07.62,def2,NANBU,0,0,0,,There used to be some on Earth in the past.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.62,0:10:09.59,def2,NANBU,0,0,0,,They look beautiful. Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.98,0:10:14.13,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,So beautiful...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.64,0:10:17.70,def2,SADO,0,0,0,,What's all the commotion about ?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.31,0:10:22.12,def2,SADO,0,0,0,,Is that...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.05,0:10:32.57,def2,MANI,0,0,0,,I feel a sense of nostalgia.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.93,0:10:35.88,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,A taste of grandma's rice cake...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.99,0:10:44.36,def2,KATO,0,0,0,,Tsubasa, Makoto...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.38,0:10:53.73,def2,YAMAMOTO,0,0,0,,Akio...?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.02,0:11:07.22,def2,KEYMAN,0,0,0,,What are you staring at ?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.72,0:11:12.05,def2,YAMAMOTO,0,0,0,,Lieutentant Keyman...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.65,0:11:22.63,def2,SADO,0,0,0,,This isn't so good...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.27,0:11:24.26,def2,KATSURAGI,0,0,0,,About what ?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.71,0:11:26.08,def2,SADO,0,0,0,,The fireflies.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.08,0:11:27.02,def2,KATSURAGI,0,0,0,,Fireflies ?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.72,0:11:29.33,def2,SADO,0,0,0,,You aren't affected ?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.89,0:11:31.77,def2,KATSURAGO,0,0,0,,No. \NHow about you, Doctor ?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.95,0:11:35.42,def2,SADO,0,0,0,,I prefer sake.{rather take "sake."}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.84,0:11:39.78,def2,WOMAN,0,0,0,,So beautiful...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.56,0:11:43.08,def2,NAGAKURA,0,0,0,,Wow...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.08,0:11:44.58,def2,SAITO,0,0,0,,Hey, is this okay ?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.58,0:11:46.65,def2,SAITO,0,0,0,,I thought those{you} weren't supposed \Nto be released {it }from the canisters.{pellet.}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.48,0:11:51.23,def2,NAGAKURA,0,0,0,,Who's that ? \NHe looks like a ghost.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.23,0:11:52.32,def2,SAITO,0,0,0,,How pathetic.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.19,0:12:00.55,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Captain Okita, what should I...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.46,0:12:06.18,def2,SAITO,0,0,0,,Kodai, you're such a lucky guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.61,0:12:07.67,def2,NAGAKURA,0,0,0,,Hey, Commander.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.59,0:12:10.44,def2,NAGAKURA,0,0,0,,Ouch...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.72,0:12:12.23,def2,NAGAKURA,0,0,0,,Commander.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.35,0:12:19.38,def2,SAITO,0,0,0,,On both the 11th planet and\N Stravase, you were saved by luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.38,0:12:22.02,def2,SAITO,0,0,0,,You haven't made a tough decision yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.23,0:12:24.25,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Probably not.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.08,0:12:27.03,def2,SAITO,0,0,0,,What about the future ?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.03,0:12:30.84,def2,SAITO,0,0,0,,Are you going to put the ship in danger\N because of your humanitarian views ?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.01,0:12:40.53,def2,SAITO,0,0,0,,Then hurry back to Earth, \Nand let us get off the Yamato !
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.53,0:12:42.45,def2,SAITO,0,0,0,,I want to be on a ship where I can fight !
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.20,0:12:47.62,def2,SAITO,0,0,0,,There's no need for a ship of cowards.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.06,0:12:49.97,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Take back what you said.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.54,0:12:54.51,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Take back what you said.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.71,0:13:07.63,def2,NAGAKURA,0,0,0,,There you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.63,0:13:09.28,def2,NAGAKURA,0,0,0,,Operations Chief Mori, we have a problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.28,0:13:11.76,def2,NAGAKURA,0,0,0,,Our commander and Acting Captain Kodai are...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.38,0:13:17.85,def2,YUKI,0,0,0,,Kodai...?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.12,0:13:22.28,def2,SAITO,0,0,0,,I don't mean to be disrespectful\N to the spirits of the war dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.28,0:13:26.04,def2,SAITO,0,0,0,,But you don't know how hard it is to keep waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.13,0:13:31.08,def2,SAITO,0,0,0,,{senji}I was saved by Hijikata during the war.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.08,0:13:33.22,def2,SAITO,0,0,0,,I'll owe him forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.28,0:13:37.34,def2,SAITO,0,0,0,,But many didn't make it...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.26,0:13:43.48,def2,SAITO,0,0,0,,...while waiting for help that never came, while \Ncrawling in the mud that smelled of dead bodies...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.55,0:13:50.10,def2,SAITO,0,0,0,,You should know that you can still sense the \Nsmell of dead bodies in the vacuum of space !
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.57,0:13:58.11,def2,SAITO,0,0,0,,All the survivors carry the burden of letting them die.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.15,0:14:01.67,def2,SAITO,0,0,0,,Letting them die...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.10,0:14:20.84,def2,SAITO,0,0,0,,{oretachi}We must avenge the dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.00,0:14:23.64,def2,SAITO,0,0,0,,But what the hell are you doing ?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.64,0:14:25.90,def2,KATO,0,0,0,,Hey, he's the Acting Captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.48,0:14:29.90,def2,KATO,0,0,0,,You're a soldier, aren't you ?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.47,0:14:31.34,def2,SAITO,0,0,0,,Say what ?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.34,0:14:32.09,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.63,0:14:35.09,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Forget about titles.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.15,0:14:43.91,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,I don't care what you \Nsay about me, but the Yamato...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.92,0:14:45.98,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,...is Okita's ship !
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.08,0:14:48.28,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Apologize !
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.52,0:14:49.49,def2,SAITO,0,0,0,,Interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.97,0:14:51.28,def2,NAGAKURA,0,0,0,,Hey, are you guys serious ?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.28,0:14:53.88,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,What's the problem ? Let them do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.88,0:14:56.38,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,{soso}Right. \NWe have to settle this.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.38,0:14:58.92,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,{jodan}Don't be ridiculous.\N This won't end with a few scratches.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.92,0:15:01.23,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,{taicho}Commander, you're facing an amateur.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.23,0:15:03.59,def2,YUKI,0,0,0,,Both of you, stop ! Just stop !
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.45,0:15:10.63,def2,TOKUGAWA,0,0,0,,Engine problem. \NThe wave motion reactor is unstable.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.63,0:15:14.72,def2,TOKUGAWA,0,0,0,,Energy must be flowing back into the conductor pipe.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.63,0:15:18.15,def2,KEYMAN,0,0,0,,That's it. \NThat frequency range.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.45,0:15:25.78,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,It's a success. If we emit this wave,\N the hypnosis will be cured.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.32,0:15:31.93,def2,SAITO,0,0,0,,What ? What happened ?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.50,0:15:33.43,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Commander Saito.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.83,0:15:35.78,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,It's an emergency. \NYou're in charge here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.11,0:15:38.68,def2,SAITO,0,0,0,,You can count on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.51,0:15:50.43,def2,TOKUGAWA,0,0,0,,Are they going to devour the system ?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.41,0:15:52.18,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Mr. Sanada !
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.63,0:15:54.53,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,Kodai, so you're safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.53,0:15:58.78,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,Chief Engineer, bypass the wave motion\N coil to send energy to the engine.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.32,0:16:02.18,def2,TOKUGAWA,0,0,0,,{\c&HEEEDB8&}Are you going to burn the fireflies ?\N That's too risky !
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.53,0:16:06.68,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,It'll be too late if we lose pressure because of erosion to the conductive pipe. Hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.96,0:16:10.07,def2,TOKUGAWA,0,0,0,,If we fail, the Yamato might blow up.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.30,0:16:13.68,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,We have to do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.68,0:16:14.68,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Chief Engineer...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.68,0:16:16.48,def2,ANALYZER,0,0,0,,Everyone, hold your breath.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.76,0:16:33.23,def2,KEYMAN,0,0,0,,Are they dead ?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.04,0:16:39.63,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Chief Engineer, what's the situation ?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.63,0:16:43.77,def2,TOKUGAWA,0,0,0,,{\c&HEEEDB8&}Current engine output is 50%.\NEverything is normal.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.32,0:16:47.58,def2,SADO,0,0,0,,So my bug killer worked, huh ?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.47,0:16:49.88,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Dr. Sado...?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.46,0:16:52.43,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,Bug killer ?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.43,0:16:55.51,def2,SADO,0,0,0,,It's actually for a virus, instead of a bug.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.86,0:17:00.58,def2,SADO,0,0,0,,I didn't know if it'd work, but I had it just in case.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.14,0:17:02.33,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,I didn't notice.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.33,0:17:06.83,def2,SADO,0,0,0,,Don't blame yourself. \NYou still stopped their effect on brainwaves.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.16,0:17:09.35,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,Well, that was Keyman's...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.46,0:17:14.02,def2,KATSURAGI,0,0,0,,Is your device still intact ?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.80,0:17:17.77,def2,KATSURAGI,0,0,0,,I thought I'd be able to see you if I waited in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.47,0:17:24.11,def2,KATSURAGI,0,0,0,,Yes, this warmth.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.72,0:17:25.80,def2,KEYMAN,0,0,0,,What's on your mind ?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.86,0:17:30.33,def2,KATSURAGI,0,0,0,,I won't say anything. {'ll keep my mouth shut.}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.29,0:17:38.48,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,Once again, a cosmo wave from Telezart...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.59,0:17:44.98,def2,SHIMA,0,0,0,,Mr. Sanada, is that...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.43,0:17:48.25,def2,YUKI,0,0,0,,There's nothing on radar.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.84,0:17:51.28,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,Space is warped, and energy is rising.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.04,0:17:56.58,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,A dimensional projection ? If so, from where ?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.60,0:18:00.73,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,Evasive maneuvers !
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.08,0:18:01.98,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Wait !
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.16,0:18:15.98,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,Kodai...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.32,0:18:23.07,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,{\c&HEEEDB8&}Neither time nor space is an issue, but there are things you can't see until you get closer.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.55,0:18:27.92,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,{\c&HEEEDB8&}You have all come this far, \Neven without any concrete evidence.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.92,0:18:30.92,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,{\c&HEEEDB8&}This time, we'll show you the proof.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.23,0:18:39.16,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Mr. Okita, I'm no good.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.13,0:18:45.97,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,I can't manage the crew as a leader.\N I couldn't keep your promise with Starsia.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.52,0:18:51.24,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,What should I do now ? \NHow should I lead the Yamato ?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.00,0:18:55.65,def2,OKITA,0,0,0,,{\c&HEEEDB8&}Kodai, you're doing well.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.65,0:19:00.98,def2,OKITA,0,0,0,,{\c&HEEEDB8&}Don't you think you've done well so far ?{re doing} {very }{well ?}{, don't you think so ?}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.34,0:19:05.47,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.84,0:19:10.60,def2,OKITA,0,0,0,,{\c&HEEEDB8&}Your heart knows which direction to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.07,0:19:12.23,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Wait, Captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.93,0:19:14.68,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Mr. Okita...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.69,0:19:17.78,def2,OKITA,0,0,0,,{\c&HEEEDB8&}Follow your heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.68,0:19:34.36,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,Is that what he meant by showing us proof ?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.72,0:19:36.79,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Teresa...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.18,0:19:49.26,def2,YAMAMOTO,0,0,0,,Beautiful...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.62,0:19:54.67,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Teresa...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.65,0:20:04.12,def2,HIJIKATA,0,0,0,,I understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.03,0:20:06.88,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Would you accept then ?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.24,0:20:10.23,def2,HIJIKATA,0,0,0,,I'm a loser.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.87,0:20:20.17,def2,HIJIKATA,0,0,0,,But I'll tag along.\N I've seen it after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.87,0:20:22.06,def2,NAGAKURA,0,0,0,,I saw it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.23,0:20:23.08,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.08,0:20:25.58,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,It was my late sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.58,0:20:29.54,def2,SHINOHARA,0,0,0,,You're no longer our guest. \NWelcome to the Yamato.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.52,0:20:33.08,def2,KATO,0,0,0,,How about you ?\N Who was in your vision ?{whose illusion did you see ?}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.44,0:20:35.16,def2,SAITO,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.61,0:20:40.30,def2,SAITO,0,0,0,,I don't know what's going on,\N but we were called, too, right ?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.83,0:20:42.65,def2,KATO,0,0,0,,Right. Welcome aboard.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.54,0:20:44.31,def2,SAITO,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.31,0:20:48.63,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,We have the option of turning back.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.63,0:20:54.30,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,HQ's order was to make the decision ourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.72,0:20:56.88,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Let's move forward.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.63,0:21:01.98,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,There's something out there, something seeking help.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.98,0:21:05.88,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,It can only pray, despite a tough situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.88,0:21:08.85,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Even so, it won't{doesn't} stop praying.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.33,0:21:13.92,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,We humans won't{don't} stop either.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.15,0:21:20.55,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,{\c&HEEEDB8&}Set the base course to Telezart.\N We'll initiate a warp in two hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.74,0:21:26.20,def2,HIJIKATA,0,0,0,,They're your kids. I knew it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.43,0:21:34.73,Karaoke Translation op,TEXT,0,0,0,,{\3c&H000000&\pos(220,866)}Episode 10
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.43,0:21:34.73,Karaoke Translation op,TEXT,0,0,0,,{\3c&H000000&\pos(400,1046)}Deceptive Space Fireflies Bring Danger
