Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.43,0:21:47.78,Karaoke Translation op,CAST1,0,0,0,,{\3c&H000000&\a5\pos(1222,66)}Ono Daisuke\NKuwashima Houko\NSuzumura Kenichi \NOtsuka Hochu\NAkabane Kenji \NKokubun Masato\NChiba Yuki\NMugihito\NChiba Shigeru\NCho\NHosoya Yoshimasa\NHirata Daisuke\NTanaka Rie\NKomoto Jiro\NFujinuma Kento\NMatsumoto Shinobu
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.78,0:21:56.63,Karaoke Translation op,CAST2,0,0,0,,{\3c&H000000&\a3\pos(1304,836)}Saito Hajime: \NShiori Nagakura: \NAmagi Toshiro:\NKurata Masaru:\NOkita Juzo:\NHijikata Ryu:\NKodai Mamoru\NToudo Heikuro: \NDesler:\NKeyman:\NZorder: \NSabera:\NGailane:\NZarvival:\NGoland:\NNol:\NGenitz: \NLazera:
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.78,0:21:56.63,Karaoke Translation op,CAST2,0,0,0,,{\3c&H000000&\a5\pos(1334,118)}Touchi Hiroki\NAmagai Kazusa\NSaito Jiro\NYoshikai Kiyoto\NSugao Takayuki\NIshizuka Unsho\NMiyamoto Mitsuru\NKojima Toshihiko\NYamadera Koichi\NKamiya Hiroshi \NTezuka Hideaki \NKaida Yuko\NShibata Hidekatsu \NYara Yusaku\NYamaji Kazuhiro\NHikami Takahiro\NUmezu Hideyuki\NHarasawa Kouki
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.08,0:21:43.30,def2,ENDSONG,0,0,0,,{\i1\c&HFFFFFF&}Kienai de aoi tsuki yo
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.08,0:21:43.30,def2,ENDSONG,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}Blue moon, please don't fade away
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.30,0:21:51.17,def2,ENDSONG,0,0,0,,{\i1\c&HFFFFFF&}Terashidasu kimi hitohira
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.30,0:21:51.17,def2,ENDSONG,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}It lights up my love just enough
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.30,0:22:08.40,def2,ENDSONG,0,0,0,,{\i1\c&HFFFFFF&}Nani hitotsu kawaranai
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.30,0:22:08.40,def2,ENDSONG,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}Everything was routine
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.38,0:22:14.69,def2,ENDSONG,0,0,0,,{\i1\c&HFFFFFF&}Monotone iro no hibi
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.38,0:22:14.69,def2,ENDSONG,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}Monotone days for so long
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.62,0:22:20.69,def2,ENDSONG,0,0,0,,{\i1\c&HFFFFFF&}Unmei ga tsurete kita
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.62,0:22:20.69,def2,ENDSONG,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}Fate brought you to me
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.69,0:22:27.06,def2,ENDSONG,0,0,0,,{\i1\c&HFFFFFF&}Kimi no me ni koi wo shita
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.69,0:22:27.06,def2,ENDSONG,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}I fell in love with your eyes
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.63,0:22:33.02,def2,endsong,0,0,0,,{\i1\c&HFFFFFF&}Chikaku ni kanjitai yo
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.63,0:22:33.02,def2,endsong,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}I want to feel you close
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.45,0:22:39.99,def2,ENDSONG,0,0,0,,{\i1\c&HFFFFFF&}Atatakai te ni furete
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.45,0:22:39.99,def2,ENDSONG,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}Touching your warm hands
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.23,0:22:45.60,def2,ENDSONG,0,0,0,,{\i1\c&HFFFFFF&}Aa sugu ni kotoba ni dekitara
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.23,0:22:45.60,def2,ENDSONG,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}Wishing I could put this into words right away
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.32,0:22:51.67,def2,ENDSONG,0,0,0,,{\i1\c&HFFFFFF&}Konnani ai shiteru
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.32,0:22:51.67,def2,ENDSONG,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}I love you so much
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.13,0:22:57.87,def2,ENDSONG,0,0,0,,{\i1\c&HFFFFFF&}Kakurenai de koigokoro yo
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.13,0:22:57.87,def2,ENDSONG,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}Loving feelings, please don't hide
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.27,0:23:03.65,def2,ENDSONG,0,0,0,,{\i1\c&HFFFFFF&}Kimi dake terashiteru yo
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.27,0:23:03.65,def2,ENDSONG,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}It sheds light only on you
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.43,0:23:10.61,def2,ENDSONG,0,0,0,,{\i1\c&HFFFFFF&}Konya nara sou ieru
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.43,0:23:10.61,def2,ENDSONG,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}I can say that because tonight is different
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.72,0:23:36.38,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,He's going to have his own fleet ?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.38,0:23:38.91,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,Yes, by direct order of the Emperor.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.69,0:23:44.68,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,Why ? He was just some half dead\N loser that was drifting in space.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.39,0:24:01.18,def2,SABERA,0,0,0,,We, Gatlantis, have no equivalent word for\N "demoted general's position" or "second chance."
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.18,0:24:05.13,def2,SABERA,0,0,0,,It is unusual for us to entrust\N a fleet to someone like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.13,0:24:07.27,def2,SABERA,0,0,0,,You had better thank His Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.27,0:24:08.30,def2,ZORDER,0,0,0,,Sabera...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.63,0:24:12.34,def2,ZORDER,0,0,0,,...pay respect to the king of a nation.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.14,0:24:20.20,def2,ZORDER,0,0,0,,I want you to show us something...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.83,0:24:24.04,def2,ZORDER,0,0,0,,...and it's called...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.03,0:24:26.22,def2,ZORDER,0,0,0,,...tenacity.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.99,0:24:31.35,def2,ZORDER,0,0,0,,I've arranged the gift you desire most.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.74,0:24:37.97,def2,ZORDER,0,0,0,,How is it, Fuhrer Desler ?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.69,0:24:42.34,def2,Much,0,0,0,,Much appreciated.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.38,0:24:45.88,def2,TEXT,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&\pos(970,662)}Preview
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.53,0:24:46.18,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,Are we surrounded ?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.18,0:24:47.63,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,All ahead full ! Pull away !
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.63,0:24:48.93,def2,WOMAN,0,0,0,,We're completely surrounded !
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.93,0:24:50.23,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,The size of the fleet is ridiculously huge !
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.23,0:24:52.03,def2,TOKUGAWA,0,0,0,,Open all suction valves !
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.03,0:24:53.48,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,At this rate, the Yamato will...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.48,0:24:58.33,def2,DESLER,0,0,0,,Watch me carefully.\NI am a man who never forgets humiliation.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.43,0:24:59.43,Karaoke Translation op,TEXT,0,0,0,,{\3c&H000000&\fscx135\fscy103\pos(964,462)}Episode 11
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.43,0:24:59.43,def2,TEXT,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&\pos(968,684)} Challenge from Desler !

